# OPTION menu stop: same path as new-game.pad (skip intro, START to main
# menu, cross into NEW GAME) but halting on the small "Option menu"
# box instead of continuing into Sound setup.
#
# Frame survey (reports/opt-seq/opt-NNNN.ppm, EVERY=30, parent 48b1063):
#   seq ~150-172  title screen
#   seq ~174-192  OPTION header + small Sound/Key-assign/Next box
#   seq ~193+     wide Sound-setup panel (BGM/SE/Voice bars)
# Taps after @3600 are dropped: @3750/@3900 drive Option -> Sound.
# If the verify run lands on the wrong screen, move the stop / restore
# taps -- the survey above says where each screen lives in present order.
#
#   PSPRECOMP_REPLAY=scenarios/option.pad PSPRECOMP_MPEG_DECODE=1 \
#     PSPRECOMP_FRAME=reports/opt-seq/verify.ppm \
#     ./build/host/boot game/extracted/ACLR_App.elf "game/Armored Core - Last Raven Portable.iso"

drain 300
minhold 4

  mark "circle: skip the intro movie"
  @50 tap circle
  @150 tap circle
  @250 tap circle
  @350 tap circle
  @450 tap circle
  @550 tap circle
  @650 tap circle
  @750 tap circle
  @850 tap circle
  @950 tap circle
  @1050 tap circle
  @1150 tap circle
  @1250 tap circle
  @1350 tap circle
  @1500 mark "start: title screen -> main menu"
  @1550 tap start
  @1650 tap start
  @1750 tap start
  @1850 tap start
  @1950 tap start
  @2050 tap start
  @2150 tap start
  @2250 tap start
  @2350 tap start
  @2500 mark "cross: NEW GAME -- option survey stops on the Option menu"
  @2550 tap cross
  @2700 tap cross
  @2850 tap cross
  @3000 stop
